ues/98854#issuecomment-2458851018","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/98854","id":2458851018,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6SjxbK","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-06T06:58:06Z","updated_at":"2024-11-06T07:00:32Z","body":"We actually deliberately unset modifiers for key events like this:\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/87318a2fb7fffeb72adca934e31915be077c3d1f/platform/windows/display_server_windows.cpp#L5441-L5444\r\n\r\nIt was like added in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/189, before proper IME support, and might unnecessary (or at least can be only enabled while text input mode is active).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2458851018/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]